<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f8fc">
<title>PrivateChat | Private Android messaging</title>
<meta name="description" content="PrivateChat is an Android messaging project preview.">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#15283a;--muted:#5c7082;--blue:#2563eb;--paper:#f5f8fc}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
.wrap{width:min(100% - 36px,1040px);margin:auto}
nav{height:74px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.mark{width:35px;height:35px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800}
.badge{font-size:12px;color:#2253ab;background:#e7efff;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 11px;font-weight:700}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:32px;align-items:center;padding:42px 0 28px}
.kicker{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.7px;font-weight:800;color:var(--blue)}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:14px 0 18px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.lead{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);max-width:560px}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:20px}
.phone{max-width:360px;width:100%;justify-self:center;background:#fff;border:8px solid #182b3c;border-radius:34px;padding:17px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px #19324a20}
.phone-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8291a0;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:17px}
.status{background:#f3f7fb;border-radius:13px;padding:12px 13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#f4a62a;margin-right:7px}
.panel{border:1px solid #e7edf3;border-radius:16px;padding:15px;margin:10px 0}
.panel h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 5px}
.small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.code{color:var(--blue);font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;margin:12px 0 4px}
.ip{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.fake-button{display:block;text-align:center;color:white;background:var(--blue);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
.section{padding:24px 0}
.section-title{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:0 0 14px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e7edf3;border-radius:17px;padding:20px}
.card h3{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:16px}
.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.callout{background:#eaf2ff;border-radius:18px;padding:21px 23px;margin:12px 0 34px}
.callout strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}
.callout p{margin:0;color:#425970;font-size:14px}
footer{border-top:1px solid #e1e8ef;padding:20px 0 32px;color:#748393;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:700px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding-top:30px}
  .phone{max-width:390px}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  h1{letter-spacing:-2px}
  .wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1040px)}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <nav>
    <div class="brand"><span class="mark">P</span><span>PrivateChat</span></div>
    <span class="badge">Android project · v1</span>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">Private messaging for Android</div>
        <h1>Chat directly.<br>Keep it private.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          PrivateChat is a project preview for a private messaging app for two
          Android phones. This website itself does not send messages.
        </p>
        <p class="note">
          The screen shown here is an illustration, not a working chat app.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="phone" aria-label="Illustration of an Android app screen">
        <div class="phone-top"><span>9:41</span><span>Wi-Fi&nbsp;&nbsp; 100%</span></div>
        <div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>Not connected</div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Create a room</h3>
          <p class="small">Example screen only — not functional</p>
          <div class="code">7J4K 9M2Q 8V6T</div>
          <div class="ip">Example local address: 192.168.1.24</div>
          <span class="fake-button">Start hosting</span>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Join a room</h3>
          <p class="small">Example screen only — not functional</p>
          <span class="fake-button">Connect directly</span>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <h3>Messages</h3>
          <p class="small">This preview does not send or store messages.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Project goals</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>01 · Create a room</h3>
          <p>The planned Android app would let one phone create a temporary room.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>02 · Connect directly</h3>
          <p>Direct connections depend on the phones’ network settings. Same-Wi-Fi is usually simplest.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>03 · Protect messages</h3>
          <p>A real app needs tested encryption and peer authentication. This website does not provide those features.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="callout">
      <strong>Network limits</strong>
      <p>
        Without a relay server, internet connections are not guaranteed.
        Routers or mobile networks may block direct connections. This page
        does not connect phones or provide chat.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>PrivateChat project preview · This page is not the Android app.</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
